resolve: lighthouse review resolve <fingerprint> --judgment <pass|fail|notApplicable> [--suppress <justification>] [--reason <text>] --attributed-to agent:<id>
judgments: fail=the finding is right; add `suppress` with a justification to leave it in place; pass=false positive: the code conforms; notApplicable=the decision does not apply here; a hint to narrow it
